                  <Value>- Yarn supplied must strictly conform to the specifications mentioned in the Purchase Order, including count, denier, composition, shade, lustre, and quality parameters
- No denier variation shall be acceptable in the supplied yarn.In case of dyed yarn, shade variation beyond acceptable industry tolerance shall not be rmitted.
- Supplier shall ensure uniformity in quality throughout the lot. Any defects such as contamination, oil stains, knots, mixed yarn, moisture damage, or       inconsistent winding shall be treated as rejection criteria.
- Goods must be delivered only to the shipping address mentioned in the Purchase Order.
- Delivery timing shall be restricted between 9:00 AM and 7:00 PM on working days unless otherwise communicated in writing.
- Prices shall be considered strictly as per the Purchase Order. Any revision in price must be communicated and mutually approved in advance.
- Loading, unloading, freight, transit insurance, and transportation charges shall be borne entirely by the supplier unless specifically agreed otherwise.
- Supplier shall ensure proper packing of goods to avoid damage, moisture exposure, or contamination during transit.</Value>
                  <Style>
                    <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                    <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                  </Style>
                </TextRun>
              </TextRuns>
              <Style />
            </Paragraph>
